      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1050207",
      "subQuestName": "Accompany Klee to return the box to Mona",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "105020401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "105020401": {
            "id": "105020401",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "You're back at last. The wait was exceedingly dull.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020402"
            ]
          },
          "105020402": {
            "id": "105020402",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "I had intended to read a book to pass the time, but this one was just some ridiculous diary. Nothing of note in it at all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020403"
            ]
          },
          "105020403": {
            "id": "105020403",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "It dropped from Klee's backpack, so I thought it might contain some ancient knowledge, but...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020404"
            ]
          },
          "105020404": {
            "id": "105020404",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Never mind that. So, did you find the box?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020405"
            ]
          },
          "105020405": {
            "id": "105020405",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "We did. It's in perfect shape!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020406"
            ]
          },
          "105020406": {
            "id": "105020406",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "That's wonderful— Wait a moment... Wh—Why isn't it locked!? And... why is it empty!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020407"
            ]
          },
          "105020407": {
            "id": "105020407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ehhh!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020408"
            ]
          },
          "105020408": {
            "id": "105020408",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Well... it's because I borrowed this box to store my treasures.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020409"
            ]
          },
          "105020409": {
            "id": "105020409",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Borrowed!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020410"
            ]
          },
          "105020410": {
            "id": "105020410",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "But since you're here for the box, I took all my treasures out. That's why it's empty.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020411"
            ]
          },
          "105020411": {
            "id": "105020411",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "You used it to store your things!? Th—Then where are the original contents of the box? That's what I want.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020412"
            ]
          },
          "105020412": {
            "id": "105020412",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Oh. You want the thing that used to be in the box? ...You should've said so.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020413"
            ]
          },
          "105020413": {
            "id": "105020413",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "You haven't... broken it, have you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020414"
            ]
          },
          "105020414": {
            "id": "105020414",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "No! It's not broken at all!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020415"
            ]
          },
          "105020415": {
            "id": "105020415",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Phew...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020416"
            ]
          },
          "105020416": {
            "id": "105020416",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "It's the book in your hand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020417"
            ]
          },
          "105020417": {
            "id": "105020417",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Whaaaaaaat—!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020418"
            ]
          },
          "105020418": {
            "id": "105020418",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Th—This... So this book, this diary... is that hag's... It's her diary from 50 years ago!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020419"
            ]
          },
          "105020419": {
            "id": "105020419",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "The thing she wanted back after 50 years was the dark history of her youth?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020420"
            ]
          },
          "105020420": {
            "id": "105020420",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Ah, I'm finished! No wonder... No wonder that old woman said that I should not look at it no matter what, or she'd rip me to shreds...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020421"
            ]
          },
          "105020421": {
            "id": "105020421",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Am... Am I in trouble?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020422"
            ]
          },
          "105020422": {
            "id": "105020422",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "Ah! It was you who said you wanted the box. You didn't say anything about the thing inside!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020423"
            ]
          },
          "105020423": {
            "id": "105020423",
            "speakerId": 10090,
            "speakerName": "Klee",
            "text": "I don't know anything. I'm leaving! Bye!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020426"
            ]
          },
          "105020426": {
            "id": "105020426",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Umm... Well, if you don't say anything, your master won't find out, will she?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020427"
            ]
          },
          "105020427": {
            "id": "105020427",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "Impossible. Astrology can see through all lies — you've seen it yourself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020428"
            ]
          },
          "105020428": {
            "id": "105020428",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "*sigh* After having spent all my Mora to come to Mondstadt, not only have I gained no knowledge, but now I can't return... How did it come to this...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020429"
            ]
          },
          "105020429": {
            "id": "105020429",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's so sad... Maybe you could forget everything in that book, and then go back?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "105020430"
            ]
          },
          "105020430": {
            "id": "105020430",
            "speakerId": 10095,
            "speakerName": "Mona",
            "text": "That's... too difficult. And even if I wanted to stay in Mondstadt, it would be..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1050208",
